<title>USA: Muni bond sales total $505 mln for Thursday.</title>
<headline>Muni bond sales total $505 mln for Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Municipal bond sales for Thursday are expected to total $371 million in 23 sales, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>Negotiated offerings total $274 million in 12 sales, with a $79 million Lorain County, Ohio, variable rate bond deal through Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. topping the list.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
